# Personal, machine-specific Claude Code overrides. `.claude/settings.json` is
# shared and committed; `settings.local.json` is where a local override lives --
# for example pointing the dcwalker-skills marketplace at a `directory` source
# so a session loads the working tree instead of what is on GitHub. That source
# records an absolute path, so it must never be committed.
.claude/settings.local.json
